# Flutter mobile

- Guest: marketplace + QR/outlet ordering; deep links via `guest.cullinos.com`.
- Waiter: floor ops for phone and tablet—preserve responsive layouts.
- Align with guest/waiter API modules; do not embed production Firebase secrets in source.
- Document manual test notes for QA under ticket handoff when changing flows.
